Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:29.00,Handle,,0,0,0,,@Bizstring
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Would you take a test with no right answers,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.92,0:00:04.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,if your personality was judged on every single one?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.80,0:00:06.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,You might have already taken it.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.65,0:00:08.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Some employers send {\c&H2E2FD8&}dark personality tests
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.60,0:00:10.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,before you ever get an interview.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.50,0:00:11.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,Here's how they work.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.55,0:00:13.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,A coworker steals your idea.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.70,0:00:15.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,Call them out in front of everyone?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.15,0:00:16.00,Hit,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,120,\fscx100\fscy100)}NARCISSIST
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.25,Cap,,0,0,0,,Quietly tell the boss?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.25,0:00:18.15,Hit,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,120,\fscx100\fscy100)}MANIPULATOR
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.15,0:00:19.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,Let it go and never trust them again?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.95,0:00:20.90,Hit,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\fscy80\t(0,120,\fscx100\fscy100)}COLD
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.90,0:00:22.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every answer gets {\c&H2E2FD8&}flagged.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.45,0:00:24.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,Try it yourself. The test's in the comments
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.75,0:00:25.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,There's no right answer.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.82,0:00:28.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,So would you still take a test with no right answers?
